{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f85cb6dcf66e51b728b52432bd6336679fdf655a58daf4723939b156a3609d75", "ja": "美也、新しい衣装はどうだ？　着なれないタイプの\n衣装だと思うけど、問題なさそうか？", "zh": "美也，新衣服感觉怎么样？这是你不太习惯的类型，\n应该没什么问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "eafb360a77413eedc8127611b55584d095f686c9a36b18a4bd125953292812c7", "ja": "おや、{$P$}さん～。\n問題ないですよ～。巫女さん、可愛いですね～♪", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生～  \n没问题哦～巫女装很可爱呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "75ddd1b962ff062b3c3f3f11fa8e9b3f2d03c52cdc797b36f4ccf506c1849d57", "ja": "これで私も、歴史に残るような\nアイドルになれた……ということですな～。むふふ。", "zh": "这样一来，我也算是成为能名留青史的偶像了……对吧～。呜呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ccce3174feead08c5426ff48cfdecec7b8305a03b0a7aedafc784525eb378b50", "ja": "……うん？　どうしてそうなるんだ？", "zh": "……嗯？为什么会变成这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "5910fc20951ef7c469c013f8326a404312f64ddae711ca14904d30c752998044", "ja": "巫女さんは、何百年も前からずっと、\n神様の前で踊っている……昔のアイドルですから～。", "zh": "巫女小姐从几百年前起，就一直在神明面前跳舞……所以是过去的偶像啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "55d3954834595322a084e961c462a306ac9a931a09bc296fc9d88c33e472acd7", "ja": "そんな巫女さんと、同じ衣装を着られたので。\n私も、歴史的アイドルの仲間入りです～♪", "zh": "因为我穿上了和那位巫女小姐一样的服装。\n所以，我也加入历史偶像的行列了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b3ebf7944a9677be276c9ff0b0a505819f645972ae906816063d822bb16e0883", "ja": "うーん、わかるような、そうでもないような……。\n衣装を着ただけで、っていうのは、簡単すぎないか？", "zh": "嗯——好像能理解，又好像不是那么回事……\n仅仅因为穿了件服装就这么说，是不是太简单了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "039afbefe9ed65e440ec9485d4ee01131c2b388327f0090c9e8c7032fefedec7", "ja": "なんと～……。では、どうしたらいいのでしょう～？\nここはやはり、本物の巫女になるしか……？", "zh": "哎呀～……那么，该怎么办才好呢～？\n看来果然只能成为真正的巫女了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f1395fbfb1831361f8a47de0dc5359006ca98c180e32f52341ee67f358cf01af", "ja": "い、いや、転職されたら困るけど！\nそうだなぁ……。", "zh": "不、不是，你要是转行了我会很困扰的！\n让我想想啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e389dff8ec4f2535621321276ec9dca5a1bd16186d3ba36a4b479dd2ec90598f", "ja": "なんていうか、昔の巫女って、不思議な魅力の\nある存在だったと思うんだ。カリスマっていうか。", "zh": "该怎么说呢，我觉得过去的巫女是种有着不可思议魅力的存在。该说是拥有魅力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "f87400e9ccfc893ab05764de14d20df0625c209b791da6eaae5f535e79c7e50c", "ja": "カリスマ、ですか～？　む～ん、なるほど～……。", "zh": "魅力，是指这个吗～？嗯～，原来如此～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "67ace0e59f8c62ee062b2a83add594a613ba0d7bba3fc165cdf925f5c8d52018", "ja": "確かに、人の心を掴むのは難しいですな～。\n猫が相手だったら、できたかもしれませんが～。", "zh": "确实，要抓住人心可真难呢——。\n要是对象是猫的话，说不定还能做到呢——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1012_p", "source_sha256": "bd575991288befdc51b1b206742841dcc4e1b06d8a6a3103219b0062f000d404", "ja": "猫が……？", "zh": "猫……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "049387c70fa72a5c945b0cd856664f758cccb7bfbce0579fa0beb6f7026ad2cb", "ja": "この前、神社でお掃除をした時、\n猫さんがい～っぱい集まってきてくれたんです～。", "zh": "前段时间在神社打扫的时候，\n好多好多猫咪都跑过来找我了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "a41daeea175efb0468ba93fc79c9fb9a66810c352dad9273c4ab50482e54d3f4", "ja": "普通にお掃除していただけなのに、\nなんだか私は、猫にはモテモテなんですよ～♪", "zh": "明明只是在普通地打扫，\n不知为何，我就是特别受猫咪欢迎呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1015_p", "source_sha256": "188793f2e29859225292bc7489fa8158a7553c58785711cff77e216629bf983e", "ja": "ふむ……美也にはもう、カリスマはあるのかもな。\n猫に通用するなら、人間だっていけるはずだ！", "zh": "嗯……美也或许已经具备领袖气质了。既然对猫都管用，对人类应该也行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "27b51b56afe3ac4cb9c899b01de9ad566f0f03db3d51a7fb2d5ffee40995016a", "ja": "お～……これはびっくりですな～。\n私はもう、カリスマを身に着けていたんですね～。", "zh": "哦～……真是让人吃惊呀～。\n原来我已经拥有领袖气质了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "5e161d7f500d8a5534e204b1f6b4cee42c8f4c24608559215d452aa5a3d4cf61", "ja": "それなら……どうしたら、人間さんにも、\nモテモテになれるのでしょうか～？", "zh": "这样的话……要怎样才能也成为受人类欢迎的存在呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d789e7b0f2407cacc8f054a38f2ee43ff1b02818d51d57555aa2e25162a894be", "ja": "そこはやっぱり、レッスンかな？　アイドルが\nファンの心を掴むなら、歌とダンスが基本だと思うよ。", "zh": "那果然还是得靠训练吧？偶像要抓住粉丝的心，我觉得歌唱和舞蹈是基础。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "e48fb4393d582f446152dbd598a30f11a62a609426e917170cc6b0dbba4bf8ed", "ja": "なるほど、わかりました～。カリスマを磨くために、\nレッスンも頑張りますよ～。むふふ♪", "zh": "原来如此，我明白啦～为了磨炼魅力，我也会努力练习的～。唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0204_1020_p", "source_sha256": "67f9c367cb6b369bd3060feab56a2ff9700503da075d0a55fa54fd0bbd54a29c", "ja": "（やる気になってくれたな。美也の不思議な魅力が\nちゃんと伝わるように、サポートしていこう！）", "zh": "（她已经干劲十足了。为了让美也那不可思议的魅力好好传达出去，我也要支持她！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
